  <item>
    <title>EP37 星巴克中国：二十六年兴衰启示</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ebbee10decaeb0943eaf89</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ebbee10decaeb0943eaf89</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Apr 2025 10:26:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvW7rUSJmQjxLbXGlchxW0cHXlH-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 星巴克中国的四个发展阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 1999年1月星巴克首次进入中国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 星巴克进入中国前的市场调研结果以及进入策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 星巴克中国的本地化策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 星巴克中国的全球化策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> 星巴克采取类似戴比尔斯钻石的品牌策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a> 2009年星巴克中国开始盈利的主要原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> 星巴克如何确保线上渠道的高端消费体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 星巴克中国基于互联网渠道打造“第四空间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> 星巴克中国面对来自互联网模式的冲击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 星巴克与瑞幸的市场定位分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> 瑞幸咖啡抢夺星巴克市场份额的原因</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh44Rk_299MkQn6zjKiR8YC_GgO-.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>上图为星巴克在1999年北京开设中国第一家门店的照片</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>参考信息：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Starbucks: 20 Years In China</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Story of Starbucks: Coffee vs. Tea Culture in China</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Five Things Starbucks Did to Get China Right</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Looking back at nearly 20 years of Starbucks in China</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Starbucks in China: Will it lose the battle against Luckin Coffee?</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>2025，星巴克中国迎来大结局？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>星巴克入华20年，它赶上中国的八大增长趋势，现在增长停了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>从万人迷到烫手山芋：谁会接盘星巴克中国的“下沉困局”？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>外媒评星巴克中国成功路:与3.5亿中产人群搞好关系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>「特写」星巴克进入中国20年：你习惯了喝咖啡，它懂得了生存之道</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>星巴克二度牵手微信：打造移动商业数字新基建</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>星巴克社交礼品服务“用星说”正式登陆支付宝进一步提升 “第四空间”体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>腾讯与星巴克宣布战略合作：大陆门店将接入微信支付</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>星巴克的焦虑：88亿收回门店所有权、关闭379家茶饮店……</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>星巴克中国管理层持续调整，从数字营销公司挖来 CGO 管增长</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>欢迎您收听本期栏目，如果您对营销技术、广告创意、品牌传播等话题感兴趣的话，欢迎加入听友微信群，共同探讨前沿营销话题。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpzLGD-lMyEuHH7jLVQUzc2v6iXS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>制作：无穷象限栏目组</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播微信：RaphaelWong1986</span></p><span></span><p><span>技术支持：TTSmak</span></p>]]></description>
